00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:40.180
It just tastes like vegetables and eggs

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:42.590
and it's not one thing together.

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:44.771
- Shame on you, whoever
invented this recipe.

00:05:44.771 --> 00:05:47.521
(dramatic music)

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:50.190
- Out of all the omelets
that we tried today,

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:52.230
I'm definitely gonna go with
number four on this one.

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:53.680
I liked the texture of it.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:55.540
